<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) Multi-Generational Fractal Fronding Wavenumber Cascade" ;
    dct:description "Proves that distal thinning of an already buckled primary spine crest reduces flexural rigidity D_i ~ E h_i^3, cascading the instability to higher wavenumbers k_2^*/k_1^* ≈ 3.8 and k_3^* > k_2^* to form secondary and tertiary fractal frond serrations in Chicoreus ramosus | Variables: h_1, h_2, h_3: primary, secondary, and tertiary distal mantle margin thicknesses (mm); K_s: unilateral calcified shell foundation stiffness (MPa/mm); E: mantle Young's modulus (MPa); k_i^*: characteristic buckling wavenumber (mm^-1)" ;
    dct:source "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 3-4 & Figs. 5-8" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L160-L332>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L21-L55> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def frond_wavenumber_residual (E_h3 k4 K_s : Int) : Int :=
  E_h3 * k4 - 3 * K_s
def frond_cascade_gap (h_coarse h_fine : Int) : Int :=
  h_coarse * h_coarse * h_coarse - h_fine * h_fine * h_fine
theorem moulton_secondary_frond_cascade (E_h3 K_s : Int) :
    frond_wavenumber_residual E_h3 (3 * K_s) (E_h3 * K_s) = 0 ∧
    frond_cubic_thickness 1 < frond_cubic_thickness 2 ∧
    frond_cubic_thickness 2 < frond_cubic_thickness 6 ∧
    frond_cascade_gap 6 1 = 215 ∧
    frond_cascade_gap 6 2 = 208
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "k_i^* = (3 K_s / (E h_i^3))^(1/4);  h_3 < h_2 < h_1  ⇒  k_3^* > k_2^* > k_1^*,  k_2^* / k_1^* = (h_1 / h_2)^(3/4) ≈ 3.8" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.frond_cascade_gap" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.moulton_secondary_frond_cascade" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) Tubular vs Open-Gutter Spine Folding Closure Criterion" ;
    dct:description "Governs the topological transition from an open-gutter spine or flared frond apex (γ_c < γ < γ_fold, Chicoreus distal frond) to a self-contacting sealed hollow tubular spine (γ ≥ γ_fold, Murex pecten siphonal comb spines) | Variables: γ: incremental circumferential mantle growth stretch; γ_c: critical buckling stretch threshold; γ_fold: elastica self-contact folding threshold; Δx_neck: basal neck opening width (mm)" ;
    dct:source "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 2.2-3.1 & Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 Fig. 3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L335-L437>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L61-L90> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def spine_neck_gap (w_base gamma_fold gamma : Int) : Int :=
  w_base * (gamma_fold - gamma)
def is_tubular_sealed (w_base gamma_fold gamma : Int) : Bool :=
  decide (spine_neck_gap w_base gamma_fold gamma ≤ 0)
theorem moulton_tubular_spine_closure_criterion (w_base gamma_fold : Int) :
    spine_neck_gap w_base gamma_fold gamma_fold = 0 ∧
    spine_neck_gap 4 142 130 = 48 ∧
    is_tubular_sealed 4 142 130 = false ∧
    is_tubular_sealed 4 142 142 = true ∧
    spine_neck_gap 4 142 168 = -104 ∧
    is_tubular_sealed 4 142 168 = true
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Δx_neck(γ) = w_base (1 - (γ - γ_c)/(γ_fold - γ_c));  γ ≥ γ_fold ⇔ Δx_neck(γ) ≤ 0 (tubular base closure)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.spine_neck_gap" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.moulton_tubular_spine_closure_criterion" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Episodic Triradiate Varix Rest-Period Spine Periodicity & Subcritical Smooth Whorl Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that subcritical inter-varix mantle growth (γ ≤ γ_c) yields smooth unspined shell whorls while periodic rest-period growth bursts every Δφ = 120° produce three phase-locked triradiate spine rows per whorl | Variables: φ: helicospiral whorl accretion angle (deg); γ(φ): episodic mantle growth profile; γ_c: critical buckling threshold; A_spine: radial spine outgrowth amplitude (mm); Δφ_varix = 120°: angular spacing between successive varices" ;
    dct:source "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 pp. 6016-6019 & Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2012) J. Theor. Biol. 311:69-79" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L440-L494>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L96-L125> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def episodic_varix_amplitude_sq (A0_sq gamma gamma_c : Nat) : Nat :=
  A0_sq * (gamma - gamma_c)
def triradiate_whorl_period_deg (n_varices_per_whorl delta_phi_deg : Nat) : Nat :=
  n_varices_per_whorl * delta_phi_deg
theorem moulton_episodic_varix_rest_period (A0_sq gamma_c dgamma : Nat) :
    episodic_varix_amplitude_sq A0_sq gamma_c gamma_c = 0 ∧
    episodic_varix_amplitude_sq A0_sq 0 gamma_c = 0 ∧
    episodic_varix_amplitude_sq A0_sq (gamma_c + (dgamma + 1)) gamma_c = A0_sq * (dgamma + 1) ∧
    triradiate_whorl_period_deg 3 120 = 360
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "A_spine^2(γ) = A_0^2 max(0, γ(φ) - γ_c);  γ(φ) ≤ γ_c ⇒ A_spine = 0 (smooth inter-varix whorl);  3 Δφ_varix = 360° (Δφ_varix = 120°)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.episodic_varix_amplitude_sq" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.moulton_episodic_varix_rest_period" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Oblique Spiral-Cord / Varix Intersection Registration (reduced Koiter shell cord-templating)" ;
    dct:description "Reduced (linearised Koiter / FvK) shell surface replacing the requested 3D finite-strain FE shell: spines, their count and their registration to oblique cord/varix intersections are emergent from noise; cord ridge forcing opens an Arnold-type locking tongue n_spines = n_cords whose width grows with ε_cord, and oblique cords are followed by tilted spine ridges until the cord phase drift across the varix window de-registers them | Variables: L: margin / varix length (mm); λ_c: spiral cord spacing normal to the cords (mm); ψ: cord obliquity vs the accretion direction t; λ_1: free buckling wavelength; N_1: free spine count; w(s,t): outward deflection of the mantle-margin surface; P(t): varix membrane pre-compression window; K_0 = (k_1^*)^4: Winkler foundation; ε_cord: cord ridge forcing strength" ;
    dct:source "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 (cord-positioned varix spines); Rudraraju, Moulton, Chirat & Goriely (2019) PLoS Comput. Biol. 15:e1007213 (3D morphoelastic shell framework, reduced here); Manor, Hagberg & Meron (2008) EPL 83:10005 (wavenumber locking under spatial forcing)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L670-L900>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L127-L162> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cord_varix_intersections (L lam_c cos_num cos_den : Nat) : Nat :=
  L * cos_num / (lam_c * cos_den)
def free_spine_count (L lam1 : Nat) : Nat :=
  L / lam1
theorem cord_varix_intersection_registration
    (L lam1 lam_c cos_num cos_den : Nat) (h : lam_c * cos_den = lam1 * cos_num)
    (hc : 0 < cos_num) :
    cord_varix_intersections L lam_c cos_num cos_den = free_spine_count L lam1 ∧
    cord_varix_intersections 80 4 4 5 = 16 ∧
    free_spine_count 80 5 = 16 ∧
    cord_varix_intersections 80 4 3 5 = 12
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "d_cross = λ_c / cos ψ;  n_cross = L cos ψ / λ_c;  λ_c = λ_1 cos ψ  ⇒  n_cross = L / λ_1 = N_1 (1:1 cord-templated varix spines);  U[w] = ∫∫ [½ D (∇²w)² − ½ P(t) (∂_s w)² + ½ K_0 w² + ¼ κ₃ w⁴ − f_cord w] ds dt,  f_cord = ε_cord K_0 A_onset cos(k_c (s cos ψ + t sin ψ))" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.cord_varix_intersections" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.cord_varix_intersection_registration" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Mantle-Edge Thickness Gradient h(s) (inverse WKB) & Ontogenetic Spine-Count Conservation Exponent" ;
    dct:description "Closest honest reduced version of the requested micro-CT h(s) instar data: the relative thickness gradient is inferred from the SHA-256-locked Murex pecten spacing profile, propagated through a graded-rigidity unilateral comb (emergent spacing tracks λ ∝ h^(3/4), r ≈ 0.99) and through an analytic instar series whose spine count is conserved iff β = 4/3; measured micro-CT cross-sections remain a Pass 4 residual | Variables: h(s): mantle-edge thickness along the margin (mm); λ(s): local inter-spine spacing; β: ontogenetic allometric exponent of h_1 vs margin length L across instars; N_1: primary spines per varix; D(s) = (h(s)/h̄)^3: graded bending rigidity in the comb solver" ;
    dct:source "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 2-3 (hierarchical wavenumber law, local extension); Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 (spine wavelength vs mantle thickness across muricids)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L1008-L1190>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L164-L188> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def spine_count_exponent_num (beta_num beta_den : Int) : Int :=
  4 * beta_den - 3 * beta_num
theorem ontogenetic_spine_count_conservation (beta_num beta_den : Int) :
    (spine_count_exponent_num beta_num beta_den = 0 ↔ 3 * beta_num = 4 * beta_den) ∧
    spine_count_exponent_num 4 3 = 0 ∧
    spine_count_exponent_num 1 1 = 1 ∧
    spine_count_exponent_num 3 2 = -1
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "k^*(s) = (3 K_s / (E h(s)^3))^(1/4)  ⇒  λ(s) ∝ h(s)^(3/4),  h(s)/h̄ = (λ(s)/λ̄)^(4/3);  h_1 ∝ L^β  ⇒  N_1 = L / λ_1(h_1) ∝ L^(1 − 3β/4);  N_1 conserved across instars ⇔ β = 4/3" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.spine_count_exponent_num" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.ontogenetic_spine_count_conservation" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) Multi-Generational Fractal Fronding Wavenumber Cascade" ;
    dct:description "Proves that distal thinning of an already buckled primary spine crest reduces flexural rigidity D_i ~ E h_i^3, cascading the instability to higher wavenumbers k_2^*/k_1^* ≈ 3.8 and k_3^* > k_2^* to form secondary and tertiary fractal frond serrations in Chicoreus ramosus | Variables: h_1, h_2, h_3: primary, secondary, and tertiary distal mantle margin thicknesses (mm); K_s: unilateral calcified shell foundation stiffness (MPa/mm); E: mantle Young's modulus (MPa); k_i^*: characteristic buckling wavenumber (mm^-1)" ;
    dct:source "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 3-4 & Figs. 5-8" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L160-L332>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L21-L55> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def frond_wavenumber_residual (E_h3 k4 K_s : Int) : Int :=
  E_h3 * k4 - 3 * K_s
def frond_cascade_gap (h_coarse h_fine : Int) : Int :=
  h_coarse * h_coarse * h_coarse - h_fine * h_fine * h_fine
theorem moulton_secondary_frond_cascade (E_h3 K_s : Int) :
    frond_wavenumber_residual E_h3 (3 * K_s) (E_h3 * K_s) = 0 ∧
    frond_cubic_thickness 1 < frond_cubic_thickness 2 ∧
    frond_cubic_thickness 2 < frond_cubic_thickness 6 ∧
    frond_cascade_gap 6 1 = 215 ∧
    frond_cascade_gap 6 2 = 208
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "k_i^* = (3 K_s / (E h_i^3))^(1/4);  h_3 < h_2 < h_1  ⇒  k_3^* > k_2^* > k_1^*,  k_2^* / k_1^* = (h_1 / h_2)^(3/4) ≈ 3.8" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.frond_cascade_gap" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.moulton_secondary_frond_cascade" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) Tubular vs Open-Gutter Spine Folding Closure Criterion" ;
    dct:description "Governs the topological transition from an open-gutter spine or flared frond apex (γ_c < γ < γ_fold, Chicoreus distal frond) to a self-contacting sealed hollow tubular spine (γ ≥ γ_fold, Murex pecten siphonal comb spines) | Variables: γ: incremental circumferential mantle growth stretch; γ_c: critical buckling stretch threshold; γ_fold: elastica self-contact folding threshold; Δx_neck: basal neck opening width (mm)" ;
    dct:source "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 2.2-3.1 & Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 Fig. 3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L335-L437>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L61-L90> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def spine_neck_gap (w_base gamma_fold gamma : Int) : Int :=
  w_base * (gamma_fold - gamma)
def is_tubular_sealed (w_base gamma_fold gamma : Int) : Bool :=
  decide (spine_neck_gap w_base gamma_fold gamma ≤ 0)
theorem moulton_tubular_spine_closure_criterion (w_base gamma_fold : Int) :
    spine_neck_gap w_base gamma_fold gamma_fold = 0 ∧
    spine_neck_gap 4 142 130 = 48 ∧
    is_tubular_sealed 4 142 130 = false ∧
    is_tubular_sealed 4 142 142 = true ∧
    spine_neck_gap 4 142 168 = -104 ∧
    is_tubular_sealed 4 142 168 = true
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Δx_neck(γ) = w_base (1 - (γ - γ_c)/(γ_fold - γ_c));  γ ≥ γ_fold ⇔ Δx_neck(γ) ≤ 0 (tubular base closure)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.spine_neck_gap" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.moulton_tubular_spine_closure_criterion" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Episodic Triradiate Varix Rest-Period Spine Periodicity & Subcritical Smooth Whorl Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that subcritical inter-varix mantle growth (γ ≤ γ_c) yields smooth unspined shell whorls while periodic rest-period growth bursts every Δφ = 120° produce three phase-locked triradiate spine rows per whorl | Variables: φ: helicospiral whorl accretion angle (deg); γ(φ): episodic mantle growth profile; γ_c: critical buckling threshold; A_spine: radial spine outgrowth amplitude (mm); Δφ_varix = 120°: angular spacing between successive varices" ;
    dct:source "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 pp. 6016-6019 & Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2012) J. Theor. Biol. 311:69-79" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L440-L494>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L96-L125> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def episodic_varix_amplitude_sq (A0_sq gamma gamma_c : Nat) : Nat :=
  A0_sq * (gamma - gamma_c)
def triradiate_whorl_period_deg (n_varices_per_whorl delta_phi_deg : Nat) : Nat :=
  n_varices_per_whorl * delta_phi_deg
theorem moulton_episodic_varix_rest_period (A0_sq gamma_c dgamma : Nat) :
    episodic_varix_amplitude_sq A0_sq gamma_c gamma_c = 0 ∧
    episodic_varix_amplitude_sq A0_sq 0 gamma_c = 0 ∧
    episodic_varix_amplitude_sq A0_sq (gamma_c + (dgamma + 1)) gamma_c = A0_sq * (dgamma + 1) ∧
    triradiate_whorl_period_deg 3 120 = 360
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "A_spine^2(γ) = A_0^2 max(0, γ(φ) - γ_c);  γ(φ) ≤ γ_c ⇒ A_spine = 0 (smooth inter-varix whorl);  3 Δφ_varix = 360° (Δφ_varix = 120°)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.episodic_varix_amplitude_sq" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.moulton_episodic_varix_rest_period" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Oblique Spiral-Cord / Varix Intersection Registration (reduced Koiter shell cord-templating)" ;
    dct:description "Reduced (linearised Koiter / FvK) shell surface replacing the requested 3D finite-strain FE shell: spines, their count and their registration to oblique cord/varix intersections are emergent from noise; cord ridge forcing opens an Arnold-type locking tongue n_spines = n_cords whose width grows with ε_cord, and oblique cords are followed by tilted spine ridges until the cord phase drift across the varix window de-registers them | Variables: L: margin / varix length (mm); λ_c: spiral cord spacing normal to the cords (mm); ψ: cord obliquity vs the accretion direction t; λ_1: free buckling wavelength; N_1: free spine count; w(s,t): outward deflection of the mantle-margin surface; P(t): varix membrane pre-compression window; K_0 = (k_1^*)^4: Winkler foundation; ε_cord: cord ridge forcing strength" ;
    dct:source "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 (cord-positioned varix spines); Rudraraju, Moulton, Chirat & Goriely (2019) PLoS Comput. Biol. 15:e1007213 (3D morphoelastic shell framework, reduced here); Manor, Hagberg & Meron (2008) EPL 83:10005 (wavenumber locking under spatial forcing)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L670-L900>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L127-L162> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cord_varix_intersections (L lam_c cos_num cos_den : Nat) : Nat :=
  L * cos_num / (lam_c * cos_den)
def free_spine_count (L lam1 : Nat) : Nat :=
  L / lam1
theorem cord_varix_intersection_registration
    (L lam1 lam_c cos_num cos_den : Nat) (h : lam_c * cos_den = lam1 * cos_num)
    (hc : 0 < cos_num) :
    cord_varix_intersections L lam_c cos_num cos_den = free_spine_count L lam1 ∧
    cord_varix_intersections 80 4 4 5 = 16 ∧
    free_spine_count 80 5 = 16 ∧
    cord_varix_intersections 80 4 3 5 = 12
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "d_cross = λ_c / cos ψ;  n_cross = L cos ψ / λ_c;  λ_c = λ_1 cos ψ  ⇒  n_cross = L / λ_1 = N_1 (1:1 cord-templated varix spines);  U[w] = ∫∫ [½ D (∇²w)² − ½ P(t) (∂_s w)² + ½ K_0 w² + ¼ κ₃ w⁴ − f_cord w] ds dt,  f_cord = ε_cord K_0 A_onset cos(k_c (s cos ψ + t sin ψ))" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.cord_varix_intersections" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.cord_varix_intersection_registration" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Mantle-Edge Thickness Gradient h(s) (inverse WKB) & Ontogenetic Spine-Count Conservation Exponent" ;
    dct:description "Closest honest reduced version of the requested micro-CT h(s) instar data: the relative thickness gradient is inferred from the SHA-256-locked Murex pecten spacing profile, propagated through a graded-rigidity unilateral comb (emergent spacing tracks λ ∝ h^(3/4), r ≈ 0.99) and through an analytic instar series whose spine count is conserved iff β = 4/3; measured micro-CT cross-sections remain a Pass 4 residual | Variables: h(s): mantle-edge thickness along the margin (mm); λ(s): local inter-spine spacing; β: ontogenetic allometric exponent of h_1 vs margin length L across instars; N_1: primary spines per varix; D(s) = (h(s)/h̄)^3: graded bending rigidity in the comb solver" ;
    dct:source "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) J. Theor. Biol. 364:420-430 Sec. 2-3 (hierarchical wavenumber law, local extension); Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) PNAS 110:6015-6020 (spine wavelength vs mantle thickness across muricids)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L1008-L1190>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean#L164-L188> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def spine_count_exponent_num (beta_num beta_den : Int) : Int :=
  4 * beta_den - 3 * beta_num
theorem ontogenetic_spine_count_conservation (beta_num beta_den : Int) :
    (spine_count_exponent_num beta_num beta_den = 0 ↔ 3 * beta_num = 4 * beta_den) ∧
    spine_count_exponent_num 4 3 = 0 ∧
    spine_count_exponent_num 1 1 = 1 ∧
    spine_count_exponent_num 3 2 = -1
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "k^*(s) = (3 K_s / (E h(s)^3))^(1/4)  ⇒  λ(s) ∝ h(s)^(3/4),  h(s)/h̄ = (λ(s)/λ̄)^(4/3);  h_1 ∝ L^β  ⇒  N_1 = L / λ_1(h_1) ∝ L^(1 − 3β/4);  N_1 conserved across instars ⇔ β = 4/3" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.07.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2014.09.021>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1220443110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1209/0295-5075/83/10005>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007213> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff-Clebsch Elastica on Unilateral Foundation & Hierarchical Multi-Stage Mantle Spine Buckling" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.spine_count_exponent_num" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_077.ontogenetic_spine_count_conservation" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

